# Root-level agent scratch (spaxel-9bf355e0).
# One-off investigation output kept landing at the repo root and accumulating as
# tracked exhaust (24 raw tool-output dumps + 11 stale docs, removed by the
# repo-root exhaust sweep — disposition per file in
# docs/notes/root-exhaust-classification.md). These patterns ignore the next
# agent's dump at the root too, instead of only the names already deleted.
# The leading "/" is load-bearing: docs/ holds the retained siblings of these
# exact names (empty-password-test-results.md, presence-detection-verification.md,
# mothership-dashboard-access-findings.md, ...), which must stay tracked.
/*[-_]results.txt
/*[-_]results.md
/*[-_]matches.txt
/*[-_]files.txt
/*[-_]report.txt
/*[-_]report.md
/*[-_]findings.md
/*[-_]verification.md
# One-off probe scripts. Tracked shell entry points live in scripts/ and
# tests/e2e/ (run-sim-local.sh, run.sh); a script at the repo root is scratch.
/*.sh
